{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261019/photo/bkn-20261019111905425-1019_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261019113244\"/><p>公車車尾受損。（電視畫面）</p><p>日本神奈川縣藤澤市周一（19日）上午發生公車與私家車相撞事故，14人受傷送院，其中一人重傷昏迷。</p><p>涉事私家車疑從後方追撞公車導致事故，傷者包括11名公車乘客、3名私家車乘客。日媒指，涉事私家車在事發前曾與多輛車發生碰撞，警方正調查事件。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T03:38:52.724153+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T03:19:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T14:59:09.547073+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T03:37:34.582811+00:00","content_hash":"bc87b2a3c4063f2d6cd5b6813b9e9835c8763e61c8b000ad5c33b20ffb167595","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}